@startuml
title 适老化打车平台 - 数据流图 (Data Flow Diagram - Level 0 & 1)

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #E3F2FD
  BorderColor #1565C0
  FontSize 14
}

skinparam node {
  BackgroundColor #FFF3E0
  BorderColor #EF6C00
  FontSize 13
}

' ===== Level 0: Context Diagram =====
rectangle "== Level 0: 上下文数据流图 ==" as L0_HEADER #E8EAF6

actor "老年用户" as ElderlyUser
actor "亲友用户" as FamilyUser
actor "司机" as DriverUser
actor "平台客服" as PlatformOps

rectangle "适老化打车平台\n(Elderly Taxi Platform)" as System #E3F2FD

actor "110/120\n紧急服务" as EmergencySvc
actor "95128\n热线" as Hotline
actor "支付网关\n(微信/支付宝)" as PaymentGW
actor "SMS网关" as SMSGW

ElderlyUser --> System : 叫车请求/语音输入/支付选择/SOS触发
FamilyUser --> System : 查看位置/代付/接收通知
DriverUser --> System : 接单/位置上报/确认收款
PlatformOps --> System : 查看SOS告警/处理工单

System --> ElderlyUser : 订单状态/司机信息/支付结果/TTS播报
System --> FamilyUser : 行程通知/位置链接/代付请求/SOS告警
System --> DriverUser : 订单推送/导航信息
System --> PlatformOps : SOS告警/异常订单

System --> EmergencySvc : SOS调度(110/120)
System --> Hotline : 95128热线叫车
System --> PaymentGW : 支付请求
System --> SMSGW : 短信通知

@enduml